#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. Mix = the game's own TAA blended with DLAA / DLSS: calmer, a bit softer. "
"off = the game's own picture. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = ertz garbiak jokoaren errendatze-tamainan. DLSS = berdina, eta handitu egiten du jokoaren "
"Eskalatzea % 100 baino txikiagoa denean. Nahastea = jokoaren TAA propioa DLAA / DLSS-rekin "
"nahastuta: lasaiagoa, pixka bat biguinagoa. off = jokoaren irudia. Berehala gordetzen da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How much of the Mix is the game's TAA, 0 - 100 % in 10 % steps: more = calmer and softer, less = "
"sharper. Shown while Mode is Mix, or a split has a Mix side. No extra cost."
msgstr ""
"Nahastean zenbat den jokoaren TAA, % 0 - % 100, 10eko pausoetan: gehiago = lasaiagoa, biguinagoa, "
"gutxiago = zorrotzagoa. Modua Nahastea denean ikusten da, edo zatiketak nahastearen alde bat "
"duenean. Kostu gehigarririk ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your graphics card. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, a lighter Glass "
"and fence fix, mirrors without Track moving parts. low = also no Smooth mirrors, no Glass and "
"fence fix, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Zure txartel grafikorako aurrezarpenak. altua = dena aktibo (1. eredua). ertaina = 2. eredua, "
"beirazko eta hesietako konponketa arinagoa, ispiluak Mugitzen diren piezak jarraitu gabe. baxua = "
"gainera Ispilu leunak gabe, beirazko eta hesietako konponketa gabe, VR eremua % 60. Ez du inoiz "
"zuk egindako doikuntzarik aldatzen."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, fewest trails "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = xehetasun gehien, testurik zorrotzena, 2aren GPUaren 1,6 aldi. 2 (E) = orekatua, "
"trafikoaren atzean arrasto gutxien: hemendik hasi. 3 (F) = hesietan eta kableetan lasaiena, "
"mugimenduko xehetasunak lausotu ditzake, kostua 2aren berdina. 4 (M) = astunena (5 aldi), "
"pantaila laua probatzeko soilik."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the Glass and fence fix, the Light trail fix and "
"the DLAA area. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Irudiaren kalitatea: zorroztea, testuren zorroztasuna, beirazko eta hesietako konponketa, "
"argi-arrastoen konponketa eta DLAA eremua. Eskuinak taldea irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten du; menua "
"irekitzen den bakoitzean itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Irudia zorrozten du DLAAren ondoren, 0 (ezgaituta) eta 1,0 artean. Igo irudia leuna bada; gehiegi "
"izanez gero ertzetan halo argiak ageri dira. 0,1 ms inguruko kostua; 0k urratsa saltatzen du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Zorroztasunaren irismena, 1etik 4 px-ra: txikia = xehetasun fina, handia = ertz sendoagoak. "
"Aldatu zorroztasuna fin edo lodiegi badirudi; pantaila baino handiagoa den irudiak, VRn bezala, 1 "
"px baino gehiago behar du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Testuretako testu zorrotzagoa (errepide-seinaleak, aginte-panela, GPS). 0 = ezgaituta; "
"negatiboagoa = zorrotzagoa, baina dir-dir gehiago hesietan; testua lausoa bada, probatu -0,5 eta "
"-1 artean. Ia kosturik gabe."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaves: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it if "
"grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Works only while Texture sharpness is not 0. "
"Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Berdina alanbre-hesientzat, belarrarentzat eta hostoentzat: igo 0 aldera hesiek dir-dir egiten "
"badute, jaitsi belarra bigun ikusten bada. berdina = goiko lerroari jarraitzen dio. "
"Testura-zorroztasuna 0 ez denean soilik dabil. Ia kosturik gabe."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Wires, fences and windows are treated as the thing in front, not as what you see through them, so "
"they do not smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms "
"per eye."
msgstr ""
"Alanbreak, hesiak eta leihoak aurrean dagoen gisa tratatzen dira, ez haien bidez ikusten dena "
"bezala, beraz ez dira lausotzen mugitzean. Ezgaitu han lausotzerik ikusten ez baduzu: begi "
"bakoitzeko 0,02 - 0,06 ms aurrezten ditu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: the glows are "
"drawn fresh each frame instead of being blended with older frames. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp "
"glows flicker, 0 = off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Kale-farolen eta auto-argien distirak mugitzean arrastorik ez uzteko: distirak fotograma "
"bakoitzean berriro marrazten dira, fotograma zaharrekin nahastu beharrean. % 25eko urratsak; "
"jaitsi distirek keinuka egiten badute, 0 = ezgaituta. Begi bakoitzeko 0,05 - 0,2 ms inguru "
"kostatzen du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: begi bakoitzaren erdiguneak bakarrik jasotzen du DLAA (%20tik %100era); ertzak jokoaren "
"irudia mantentzen du. Jaitsi eredu astunago bat ordaintzeko edo fps irabazteko; %40k ereduaren "
"%40 inguru balio du. Garajeko / menuko kamioia ere finkatzen du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"DLAAk pieza mugikorrak eta kamioiaren ispiluak nola tratatzen dituen. Eskuinak taldea irekitzen "
"du, Ezkerrak ixten; menua irekitzen den bakoitzean itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA follows each moving thing on its own (traffic, wheels, number plates), so it stays sharp and "
"leaves no trail. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: everything then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"DLAA-k mugitzen den gauza bakoitza bere aldetik jarraitzen du (trafikoa, gurpilak, matrikulak), "
"beraz zorrotz geratzen da eta ez du arrastorik uzten. Ezgaitu soilik begi bakoitzeko 0,5 ms "
"inguru aurrezteko edo probatzeko: orduan dena kamerarekin mugitzen da eta trafikoa lausotzen da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Smooths the truck mirrors too, so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can leave "
"trails in the glass; the others follow each moving thing."
msgstr ""
"Kamioiaren ispiluak ere leuntzen ditu, dir-dir egin ez dezaten. ispilu 1 = handiena soilik (zure "
"ondoko ispilu nagusia). guztiak = ispilu guztiak. kamera = ispilu bakoitzeko merkeena, mugitzen "
"den trafikoak arrastoak utz ditzake beiran; besteek mugitzen den gauza bakoitza jarraitzen dute."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"gaituta = ispilu bakoitzak bere DLAA jasotzen du 2 fotogramatik behin eta tartean azken irudi "
"garbia erakusten du: kostuaren erdia inguru. Ertzak garbi; beiran mugitzen dena erdi-tasan "
"eguneratzen da. ezgaituta = ispilu guztiak fotograma guztietan."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate and CPU: CPU tuning, AMD cache cores, an FPS cap and Low delay (Reflex) for flat, an "
"FPS cap for VR. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Fotograma-tasa eta CPUa: CPU doikuntza, AMD cache nukleoak, FPS muga eta Atzerapen txikia "
"(Reflex) pantaila lauarentzat, FPS muga VRrentzat. Eskuinak taldea irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten "
"du; menua irekitzen den bakoitzean itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together. Prefer fast cores: only Intel CPUs with P-cores and E-cores. Higher "
"priority and no Windows power saving for the game: every CPU, Intel and AMD. Helps when the CPU "
"is the limit; no cost. Separate in dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"CPU etengailu hiru batera. Nukleo bizkorrak lehenetsi: P eta E nukleoak dituzten Intel CPUak "
"soilik. Lehentasun handiagoa eta Windowsen energia-aurrezpenik ez jokoarentzat: CPU guztiak, "
"Intel eta AMD. CPUa muga denean laguntzen du; kosturik ez. dlaa.ini-n bananduta: cpu_pcore, "
"cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"AMD X3D CPUs with two core groups (7950X3D, 9950X3D): keeps the game on the cores with the big 3D "
"V-Cache, which games like. Switches at once; off gives the game all cores back. Try it and "
"compare in a busy city. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Bi nukleo-talde dituzten AMD X3D CPUak (7950X3D, 9950X3D): jokoa 3D V-Cache handiko nukleoetan "
"mantentzen du, jokoek maite dutena. Berehala aldatzen da; ezgaituta jokoak nukleo guztiak "
"berreskuratzen ditu. Probatu eta alderatu hiri jendetsu batean. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Low delay (Reflex) on, the NVIDIA "
"driver does the limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Pantaila laua soilik. Jokoa gehienez fotograma-tasa honetan mantentzen du: fotograma-denbora "
"egonkorra, bero eta energia gutxiago. Ezarri PCak eusten duena baino pixka bat beherago. "
"Atzerapen txikia (Reflex) gaituta, NVIDIA kontrolatzaileak mugatzen du. ezgaituta = mugarik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only (NVIDIA Reflex). On = the game's frames wait less before the graphics card "
"draws them: less delay between your steering and the picture when the card is the limit. Boost "
"also keeps the card's clocks up. Same fps; small cost."
msgstr ""
"Pantaila laua soilik, NVIDIA soilik (NVIDIA Reflex). Gaituta = jokoaren fotogramek gutxiago "
"itxaroten dute txartel grafikoak marraztu aurretik: atzerapen txikiagoa lurra eta irudiaren "
"artean txartela muga denean. Boost-ek txartelaren erlojuak ere altu mantentzen ditu. FPS "
"berberak; kostu txikia."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills in the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it "
"when the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"VR soilik. erdia = jokoak entzungailuaren 2. fotograma bakoitza marrazten du (72 Hz -> 36 fps), "
"herena = 3. bakoitza; entzungailuaren fotograma-leunketak (ASW / Motion Smoothing) gainerakoa "
"erritmo egonkorrean betetzen du. Erabili fps-a gora-behera dagoenean. Turbo ezgaitzen du aktibo "
"dagoen bitartean."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering, skipping the hidden lens edges, and whether OFXR Bridge "
"/ VectorXR are found. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu "
"opens."
msgstr ""
"VR bizkortzeak: Turbo, foveated rendering, lenteen ertz ezkutuak saltatzea eta OFXR Bridge / "
"VectorXR aurkitu diren. Eskuinak taldea irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten du; menua irekitzen den "
"bakoitzean itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo switches off the headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). VR only. On = "
"the game stops waiting for the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy "
"cities, traffic). Turn it off if the picture judders."
msgstr ""
"Turbo-k entzungailuaren fotograma-leunketa ezgaitzen du (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). VR "
"soilik. Gaituta = jokoak fotograma bakoitzean entzungailuaren zain egoteari uzten dio: fps "
"gehiago CPUa muga denean soilik (hiri jendetsuak, trafikoa). Ezgaitu irudiak firrinka egiten badu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring gets one colour per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Erdigune zorrotza, ertzean xehetasun gutxiago (NVIDIA RTX soilik). GPU denbora aurrezten du "
"Eskala altuan. VR soilik. Kanpo-eraztunak kolore bat jasotzen du 2 x 2 pixeleko; hesiek, belarrak "
"eta hostoek xehetasun osoa mantentzen dute. Ezgaitu ertza koadrikulatua ikusten bada."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated rendering is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the "
"view sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Foveated rendering-en erdigune zorrotzaren tamaina, % 10 - 100, % 5eko urratsetan: handiagoa = "
"ikuspegi gehiago zorrotz, aurrezpen gutxiago; txikiagoa = aurrezpen gehiago, xehetasun baxua "
"erditik hurbilago hasten da. % 80 (orekatua) da lehenetsia; 90 = zabala, 65 = estua."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What Foveated rendering makes coarser. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + lighting = "
"also the game's lighting, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for blocky light or "
"shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Foveated rendering-ek zer egiten duen lodiago. eszena = 3D mundua soilik (lehenetsia). eszena + "
"argiztapena = jokoaren argiztapena ere, muturreko ertzean soilik: aurrezpen gehiago. Probatu: "
"bilatu argi- edo itzal-ertz koadrikulatuak ikuspegiaren aldean."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated rendering is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Foveated rendering-en kanpo-eraztuna zein lodia den. Normala = kolore 1 2 x 2 pixeleko "
"(lehenetsia). Indartsua = 4 x 2ko, Max = 4 x 4ko: GPU aurrezpen handiagoa, ertz "
"koadrikulatuagoak. Begi-jarraipenarekin onena, non inoiz ez duzun kanpo-eraztunera begiratzen."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated rendering follows your eyes on a headset with eye "
"tracking (for example Varjo); without it the centre stays in the middle of the lens. Needs "
"Foveated rendering on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Esperimentala. Foveated rendering-en erdigune zorrotzak zure begiak jarraitzen ditu "
"begi-jarraipena duen entzungailu batean (adibidez Varjo); gabe, erdigunea lentearen erdian "
"geratzen da. Foveated rendering gaituta behar du jokoa hasterakoan, bestela berrabiaraztea. Ia "
"kosturik gabe."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik. Jokoak inoiz ikusten ez dituzun lentearen izkinak saltatzen ditu (kaskoak "
"jakinarazten ditu), pixel gutxiago marrazten ditu: GPU tarte gehiago, ikusten duzun irudia "
"berdina da. Lehen aldiz gaitzeko jokoa berrabiarazi behar da. Desgaitu ikuspegiaren ertza arraroa "
"bada."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = djules75en VR fotograma-sorkuntza, bereizitako deskarga "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). aurkituta = bere geruza joko honetan kargatuta dago eta modak "
"bere lana pasatzen uzten du. Hasi bere erretilu-aplikazioa jokoaren aurretik."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = DienerTech-en OpenXR hobekuntza-multzoa (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"sakonera, fotograma-sorkuntza; aurkituta = bere geruza jokoan kargatuta dago eta modak bere lana "
"pasatzen uzten du. Erabili Turbo bakarra (berea edo modarena)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the game's own VR UI floats (HUD, menus). The mod types the change into the game's console "
"for you; needs g_developer and g_console 1 in config.cfg. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Jokoaren VR UI propioa non flotatzen duen (HUD, menuak). Mod-ak aldaketa jokoaren kontsolan "
"idazten du zuretzat; g_developer eta g_console 1 behar ditu config.cfg-n. Eskuinak taldea "
"irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's VR UI layouts the rows below move: driving (the HUD while driving) or menus "
"(the game's menu screens)."
msgstr ""
"Jokoaren VR UIaren zein diseinu mugitzen duten beheko errenkadek: gidatzea (HUDa gidatzean) edo "
"menuak (jokoaren menu-pantailak)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the game's VR UI: height, side, distance, tilt, turn, size or curve, in small steps. The "
"game gets each change about 0.4 s after your last press: the console opens and closes by itself."
msgstr ""
"Jokoaren VR UIa mugitzen du: altuera, aldea, distantzia, inklinazioa, biraketa, tamaina edo "
"kurbadura, urrats txikitan. Jokoak aldaketa bakoitza zure azken sakatzetik 0,4 s inguru geroago "
"jasotzen du: kontsola bere kabuz irekitzen eta ixten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Right: every value of both layouts back to what config.cfg had at the start (the game saves its "
"own values when it exits)."
msgstr ""
"Eskuina: bi diseinuen balio guztiak hasieran config.cfg-k zuenera itzultzen dira (jokoak bere "
"balioak irteterakoan gordetzen ditu)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR): fps, ms, "
"numbers only, each with or without a graph of recent frame times (spikes show red), or the graph "
"alone. Its GPU cost is measured. Save keeps it."
msgstr ""
"Fps eta fotograma-denborako kutxa txiki bizia, menu hau itxita dagoenean ere (laua eta VR): fps, "
"ms, zenbakiak soilik, bakoitza azken fotograma-denboren grafikoarekin edo gabe (gailurrak "
"gorriz), edo grafikoa bakarrik. GPU kostua neurtuta dago. Gorde-k mantentzen du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxaren blokeoa, posizioa, tamaina, kolorea, VR distantzia eta biraketa. Eskuinak taldea "
"irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten; menua irekitzen den bakoitzean itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxa aldamenera mugitzen du, pantailaren %tan (VR finkoa / lotua: zure inguruko graduak). "
"Pantaila lauak eta VRk bakoitzak bere posizioa gordetzen du. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxa gora / behera mugitzen du, pantailaren %tan (VR finkoa / lotua: graduak, ken = gora). "
"Pantaila lauak eta VRk bakoitzak bere posizioa gordetzen du. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxa handiago edo txikiago egiten du (0,2 .. 3,0). Igo kaskoan edo pantaila handian irakurri "
"ezin baduzu. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxaren testuaren kolorea: 20 kolore, bakoitzak ertz batekin edozein irudiren gainean "
"irakurtzeko (beltza zuriaren gainean = testu iluna, ertz zuria). Laua eta VR. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxaren distira, %10 - %100: 100 = kolorea den bezala, gutxiago testua ilunagotzen du (ertza "
"mantentzen da) beltzera. Erabili kontagailua gauez edo kaskoan apaltzeko. Laua eta VR. Kosturik "
"ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"FPS kutxa osoa zein zeharrargia den, %10 - %100: 100 = solidoa, gutxiago testua ETA bere ertz "
"beltza batera lausotzen ditu, kutxa ilundu batek orban beltz bihur ez dadin. Laua eta VR. "
"Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far back the fps graph shows: 2 - 60 s. One bar per slice of time = its slowest frame, so you "
"see spikes. Green = on time, yellow = a bit slow, red = a hitch; the line = the headset rate / "
"FPS cap / your usual. Shown when FPS counter has a graph."
msgstr ""
"FPS grafikoak zenbat denbora atzera erakusten duen: 2 - 60 s. Barra bat denbora-zati bakoitzeko = "
"bere fotograma motelena, beraz gailurrak ikusten dituzu. Berdea = garaiz, horia = pixka bat "
"motela, gorria = trabatzea; lerroa = entzungailuaren tasa / FPS muga / zure ohikoa. FPS "
"kontagailuak grafikoa duenean agertzen da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + Track "
"moving parts). No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR soilik. Buruari jarraitu = entzungailuarekin mugitzen da. Jolas-eremuan finkoa = zure "
"eserlekuaren inguruko puntu bat, kabinaren kulunka alde batera uzten du. Ibilgailuari lotua = "
"kabinari itsatsita, harekin kulunkatzen da (DLAA + Mugitzen diren piezak jarraitu behar ditu). "
"Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR, Ibilgailuari lotua bakarrik. Gaituta = kamioi / auto bakoitzak bere fps kutxaren lekua "
"gordetzen du kabinan, biraketa, tamaina, kolorea, distira eta testua (dlaa.ini-n gordetzen da "
"menua ixtean). Ezgaituta = multzo bakarra ibilgailu guztientzat. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"VR, Ibilgailuari lotua bakarrik. Eskuina = kabina berriro neurtu orain (geldi, aparkatuta) kutxa "
"tokiz kanpo badago. Ezkerra = ibilgailu honen kutxa lehenetsira bueltatzen da (lekua, biraketa, "
"tamaina, kolorea, testua); beste ibilgailuek berea mantentzen dute. Kutxa kabinarekiko zuzen dago."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik, beraz pantaila lauan grisez. FPS kutxa ezkerrera / eskuinera biratzen du bere "
"gainean, graduetan (+ = aurpegia eskuinera biratzen da). Erabili kutxa alboan dagoenean "
"okertzeko. 0 = zuri begira. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik, beraz pantaila lauan grisez. FPS kutxa makurtzen du, graduetan (+ = goialdea "
"zugandik aldentzen da, aginte-panelean etzanda bezala). 0 = zuri begira. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik, beraz pantaila lauan grisez. FPS kutxa bere planoan biratzen du, graduetan (+ = "
"erlojuaren noranzkoan). 0 = zutik. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik, beraz pantaila lauan grisez. FPS kutxa zein urrun flotatzen duen, 0,30 - 3,00 m. "
"Tamaina bera mantentzen du zure ikuspegian edozein distantziatan; sakonera bakarrik aldatzen da. "
"Jarri begiratzen duzun sakonerara hurbil, fokua aldatu gabe irakurtzeko. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Panelaren posizioa, tamaina, sakonera eta norabidea, eta menuaren teklak. Eskuinak taldea "
"irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten; menua irekitzen den bakoitzean itxita hasten da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Panel hau aldamenera mugitzen du, pantailaren %tan (VR kabinan finkoa: eserlekuaren inguruko "
"graduak). Pantaila lauak eta VRk bakoitzak bere posizioa gordetzen du. Erabili panelak behar "
"duzun zerbait estaltzen badu. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Panel hau gora / behera mugitzen du, pantailaren %tan (VR kabinan finkoa: graduak, gehi = "
"behera). Pantaila lauak eta VRk bakoitzak bere posizioa gordetzen du. Erabili panelak behar duzun "
"zerbait estaltzen badu. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Panel hau handiago edo txikiago egiten du. Igo irakurri ezin baduzu, jaitsi gehiegi estaltzen "
"badu. Pantaila lauak eta VRk bakoitzak bere tamaina gordetzen du. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik. Buruari jarraitu = panela kaskoarekin mugitzen da. Kabinan finkoa = zure "
"eserlekuaren aurrean puntu batean geratzen da, ingurura begiratzean egonkor; X / Y / sakonerak "
"puntu hori ezartzen dute (graduak, metroak). VR geruza behar du (lehenetsia). Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik, beraz pantaila lauan grisez. Panela zein urrun flotatzen duen: metrotan (0,30 - "
"3,00) VR geruza gisa, lehenetsia; begiko px-etan menu_vr_layer = 0 denean. Tamaina bera edozein "
"sakoneratan. Aldatu panelari begiratzea nekagarria bada. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR bakarrik, beraz pantaila lauan grisez. Gaituta = panela zure aldera biratzen da aldamenera "
"mugitzean, tamaina bera edozein angelutik (VR geruza gisa, lehenetsia, buruari jarraitzen dion "
"fps kutxa ere); ezgaituta = irudi laua. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches for comparing: DLAA off, the game's own TAA mixed in or side by side, the wire fixes, "
"running DLAA earlier. Nothing here is needed for normal driving. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it."
msgstr ""
"Alderatzeko etengailuak: DLAA ezgaituta, jokoaren TAA propioa nahastuta edo alboz alde, "
"alanbre-konponketak, DLAA lehenago exekutatzea. Hemen ez da ezer behar ohiko gidatzeko. Eskuinak "
"taldea irekitzen du, Ezkerrak ixten du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Mod osoa piztu edo itzaltzen du eta modua gordetzen du; ezgaituta dagoenean jokoaren irudia "
"ikusten da, alderatzeko. Desgaitzeak zati guztien kostua aurrezten du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = the mod on the left, the game's own TAA on the right, to compare (Split line position, "
"Split: left | right). Replaces Mix while on. With the game's console on, the mod switches the "
"game's Anti-aliasing for you."
msgstr ""
"on = modia ezkerrean, jokoaren TAA propioa eskuinean, alderatzeko (Zatiketa-lerroaren posizioa, "
"Zatiketa: ezk. | esk.). Nahastea ordezkatzen du aktibo dagoen bitartean. Jokoaren kontsola aktibo "
"badago, modak jokoaren anti-aliasing-a aldatzen dizu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the split line is, 0 - 100 % of the width in 5 % steps: the mod's DLAA / DLSS on the left "
"of it, the game's TAA on the right. Used only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Non dagoen zatiketa-lerroa, zabaleraren % 0 - % 100, 5eko pausoetan: ezkerrean modaren DLAA / "
"DLSS, eskuinean jokoaren TAA. Jokoaren TAA-rekin zatitzea aktibo dagoenean bakarrik erabiltzen da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What the split shows on its two sides: DLAA | TAA (the mod left, the game's TAA right), Mix | TAA "
"or DLAA | Mix (Mix = the two blended at Mix amount). DLSS instead of DLAA when upscaling. Used "
"only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Zer erakusten duen zatiketak bere bi aldeetan: DLAA | TAA (modia ezkerrean, jokoaren TAA "
"eskuinean), nahastea | TAA edo DLAA | nahastea (nahastea = biak nahastuta Nahaste-kopuruaren "
"arabera). DLSS DLAA ordez handitzean. Jokoaren TAA-rekin zatitzea aktibo dagoenean bakarrik "
"erabiltzen da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires move correctly while you drive: their movement is spread over the whole thin line. on "
"= default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is soft for a moment when "
"you switch."
msgstr ""
"Alanbre finak zuzen mugitzen dira gidatzen duzun bitartean: haien mugimendua lerro fin osoan "
"zabaltzen da. gaituta = lehenetsia. ezgaituta = alderatzeko soilik; alanbre hurbilek gehiago "
"keinukatzen dute. Irudia une batez bigun geratzen da aldatzean."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires count as in front on every pixel they touch, even where they cover only a sliver of "
"it. on = default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges such as leaves. off = only to compare; "
"near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Alanbre finak aurrean bezala zenbatzen dira ukitzen duten pixel guztietan, pixelaren zati meheak "
"bakarrik estaltzen badute ere. gaituta = lehenetsia. gaituta (A2C gabe) = hostoak bezalako ertz "
"gardenentzat ere. ezgaituta = alderatzeko soilik; alanbre hurbilek gehiago keinuka."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Esperimentala: pixel 1 baino finagoak diren urruneko alanbreak pixel 1eko lerro gisa marrazten "
"ditu, zatitan hautsi ez daitezen. Lehenespenez ezgaituta: urruneko alanbreak ilunagoak ager "
"daitezke edo dir-dir gehiago egin. Probatu eta alderatu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA runs before the game adds its glow and colour look, so lane paint, wires and "
"rails shimmer less. Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscaling or Windows HDR. Same "
"cost either way; takes about a second to switch."
msgstr ""
"Pantaila laua soilik: DLAA jokoak distira eta kolore-itxura gehitu aurretik exekutatzen da, beraz "
"errepide-markek, alanbreek eta trenbideek dir-dir gutxiago egiten dute. Alderatzeko soilik "
"aldatu. Ez da erabiltzen DLSS eskalatzearekin edo Windows HDR-rekin. Kostu bera bietan; segundo "
"bat inguru behar du aldatzeko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Bug report: press the capture key twice (or Capture now) where something looks wrong; the mod "
"writes one zip you attach to a GitHub issue. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Akats-txostena: sakatu bi aldiz harrapatze-tekla zerbait gaizki dagoen lekuan (edo Harrapatu "
"orain); modak zip bat idazten du, GitHub issue batera erantsiko duzuna. Eskuinak taldea irekitzen "
"du, Ezkerrak ixten du."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"One switch for the most complete report: log detail debug, rewind 2 s, capture Full. Off puts the "
"rows back as they were. Only this switch is saved; the forced values are never written to "
"dlaa.ini."
msgstr ""
"Txosten osoenerako etengailu bat: erregistro-xehetasuna debug, 2 s atzera-biribilketa, "
"Harrapaketa Osoa. Ezgaituta lerroak lehengo moduan uzten ditu. Etengailu hau bakarrik gordetzen "
"da; behartutako balioak ez dira inoiz dlaa.ini-n idazten."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics and timing "
"measurements (a little slower)."
msgstr ""
"Zer doa dlaa_inject.log-era: ezgaituta = ezer ez; erroreak = hutsegiteak soilik (lehenetsia); "
"abisuak = + saihestutako arazoak; info = + abiarazpena eta aldaketak; arazketa = + estatistikak "
"eta denbora-neurketak (pixka bat motelago)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Keeps the last 0.5 - 3 s of frames on the graphics card all the time, so the report shows the "
"moment BEFORE the key (+ what DLSS got for the last frames). Costs graphics memory (the MB in the "
"cost column) and a picture copy per frame. off = none."
msgstr ""
"Azken 0,5 - 3 s-ko fotogramak txartel grafikoan mantentzen ditu etengabe, beraz txostenak tekla "
"baino LEHENAGOKO unea erakusten du (+ DLSS-k azken fotogramentzat jaso zuena). Bideo-memoria "
"kostatzen du (kostu-zutabeko MB) eta irudi-kopia bat fotograma bakoitzeko. ezgaituta = bat ere ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Quick = system info, logs, settings, your picture and DLAA off for a few frames (about 1 s). Full "
"= + what DLSS got per frame (colour, motion, depth) and A/B sets: motion view, motion off, jitter "
"only (about 2 - 4 s)."
msgstr ""
"Azkarra = sistemaren info, erregistroak, doikuntzak, zure irudia eta DLAA ezgaituta fotograma "
"gutxitan (1 s). Osoa = + DLSS-k fotograma bakoitzeko jaso zuena (kolorea, mugimendua, sakonera) "
"eta A/B multzoak: mugimendu-ikuspegia, mugimendua ezgaituta, jitter soilik (2 - 4 s)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The capture key. Press it TWICE within 1 s while driving where it goes wrong (the first press "
"only arms it: one short beep). Right opens the Hotkeys page on its line to change it."
msgstr ""
"Harrapatze-tekla. Sakatu BI aldiz 1 s-an barruan gidatzen ari zarela zerbait gaizki doan lekuan "
"(lehen sakatzeak prestatu bakarrik egiten du: bip labur bat). Eskuinak Lasterbideen orria "
"irekitzen du lerro horretan aldatzeko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How many captures stay in the dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL: older ones (folder + zip) are "
"deleted when a new one is written. all = never delete."
msgstr ""
"Zenbat harrapaketa gelditzen diren DLLaren ondoko dlaa_selftest karpetan: zaharrenak (karpeta + "
"zip) ezabatzen dira berri bat idazten denean. guztiak = ez ezabatu inoiz."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Menu honen hizkuntza. auto = jokoaren hizkuntza (lehenetsia); Ezkerra / Eskuina beste bat "
"aukeratzen du. Linux / Proton: txinera, japoniera eta koreerak beren letra-tipoak instalatuta "
"behar dituzte, ikusi README. DLLaren ondoko lang\\<code>.po fitxategiak lehentasuna du, zure "
"zuzenketentzat. Gorde-k mantentzen du. Kosturik ez."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Menu honen lasterbide guztiak, ekintza bakoitzeko lerro bat, teklatuko teklarekin eta "
"kontrolagailuko botoiarekin. Eskuinak zerrenda irekitzen du; aukeratu ekintza bat Eskuinarekin "
"eta sakatu tekla edo boluntearen botoi berria. Berehala gordetzen da dlaa.ini-n."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Hemen erakusten den guztia dlaa.ini-n idazten du (doikuntzak, eta panelaren / fps kutxaren "
"posizioak mugitu ondoren), beste lerroak mantenduz. Egin ezazu emaitza gustatzen zaizunean, "
"bestela aldaketak galtzen dira hurrengo hasieran. Modua bere kabuz gordetzen da."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, preset, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, CPU, log "
"detail), live and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Menu honetako doikuntza guztiak modak ekartzen dituen moduan uzten ditu berriro (eredua, "
"zorroztea, testuren zorroztasuna, DLAA eremua, mugimendua, ispiluak, aurrezarpena, panela, fps "
"kutxa, turbo, foveated, fotograma-tasa, CPUa, erregistroa), zuzenean eta dlaa.ini-n, zure "
"lasterbideak eta gainerako lerroak mantenduz."

