#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%hs = capture now (the menu closes first). The zip (dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL) holds "
"system info, the mod's and the game's log, dlaa.ini, your picture and DLAA off; Full adds what "
"DLSS got and the A/B sets; rewind adds the moment before. Your user name and home folder are "
"removed. %ls"
msgstr ""
"%hs = harrapatu orain (menua lehenengo ixten da). Zip-ak (DLLaren ondoko dlaa_selftest karpeta) "
"sistemaren informazioa, modaren eta jokoaren erregistroa, dlaa.ini, zure irudia eta DLAA "
"ezgaituta daramatza; Osoak DLSS-k jaso zuena eta A/B multzoak gehitzen ditu; atzera-biribilketak "
"aurreko unea gehitzen du. Zure erabiltzaile-izena eta etxeko karpeta kendu egiten dira. %ls"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The 5 keys that open and drive this menu: %hs opens / closes it (the value), %hs / %hs / %hs / "
"%hs move (Hotkey column). While the menu is open only these 5 are kept from the game. %hs: change "
"them on the Hotkeys page."
msgstr ""
"Menu hau irekitzen eta gidatzen duten 5 teklak: %hs-k irekitzen / ixten du (balioa), %hs / %hs / "
"%hs / %hs mugitzen dira (Lasterbidea zutabea). Menua irekita dagoenean 5 hauek bakarrik kentzen "
"zaizkio jokoari. %hs: aldatu Lasterbideak orrian."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Closes the menu; the 5 menu keys go back to the game. %hs does the same from any row."
msgstr ""
"Menua ixten du; menuko 5 teklak jokora itzultzen dira. %hs-k gauza bera egiten du edozein "
"lerrotatik."

